                        <seg type="script" cert="medium">Script from the second half of the seventeenth century to the first half of the eighteenth century (?).</seg>
                        <seg type="ink">Black, red (crimson on <locus target="#23v #42r"/>)</seg>.
                        <desc>Fine, careful. The same scribe as of manuscript <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESdd030">Bǝḥerāwi Kǝllǝlāwi Mangǝśti Tǝgrāy, Dabra Dāmmo ʾAbuna ʾAragāwi, C3-IV-274</ref>.
                          </desc>
                        
